Package: vinexplorer
Title: Wine Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anastasiia", "Galiagina", , "anastasiiagaliagina@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Explore wines on an interactive map via a 'Shiny' app. Users
    can filter by wine color, click a country or region to list available
    wines, and view details such as grape, vintage, price, and tasting
    notes.
